      }
    },
    "The FFmpeg build bundled with this copy of SubTrack is configured with libx264 and libx265, which are licensed under the GNU General Public License (GPL) version 2 or later. The combined work is therefore distributed under the GPL v2+.\n\nThis software uses code of the FFmpeg project licensed under the GPLv2+.\n\nFFmpeg — Copyright © 2000–2026 the FFmpeg developers.\nx264 — Copyright © 2003–2024 the x264 project.\nx265 — Copyright © 2013–2024 MulticoreWare, Inc.\n\nThe full text of the GNU GPL v2 is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html. FFmpeg source and license information are available at https://www.ffmpeg.org." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die mit dieser Kopie von SubTrack gelieferte FFmpeg-Version ist mit libx264 und libx265 konfiguriert, die unter der GNU General Public License (GPL) Version 2 oder höher lizenziert sind. Das Gesamtwerk wird daher unter der GPL v2+ vertrieben.\n\nDiese Software verwendet Code des FFmpeg-Projekts, der unter der GPLv2+ lizenziert ist.\n\nFFmpeg – Copyright © 2000–2026 die FFmpeg-Entwickler.\nx264 – Copyright © 2003–2024 das x264-Projekt.\nx265 – Copyright © 2013–2024 MulticoreWare, Inc.\n\nDen vollständigen Text der GNU GPL v2 findest du unter https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html. Quellcode und Lizenzinformationen zu FFmpeg findest du unter https://www.ffmpeg.org."
          }
        }
      }
    },
